{"about_the_game":"<strong>Hell to Raze</strong> is a top-down Hack and Slash platformer that focuses on grappling for combat and navigation. Play as the Prince of Hell fighting to reclaim his throne after being framed for his fathers\u2019 murder. The prince uses his sword to grapple and swing through hell; slaying any demons that get in his way. You will confront multiple different enemies and puzzles that require the use of your sword to attack and grapple with. As you move through the layers of hell, the story unravels of who betrayed you and murdered the king; granting insight to the background of this stylized world. <br><br>Key Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiple special attacks acquired from defeating bosses <br></li><li>Earn new abilities as you gain experience from defeating enemies<br></li><li>Stylized levels and bosses that carry their own theme</li></ul><br>Hell to Raze was created by a team of 14 students in the Entertainment Arts and Engineering (EAE) Undergrad Program at the University of Utah.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1254950?t=1597156764","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1254950?t=1597156764","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1254950/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1597156764","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1254950/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1597156764","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<strong>Hell to Raze</strong> is a top-down Hack and Slash platformer that focuses on grappling for combat and navigation. Play as the Prince of Hell fighting to reclaim his throne after being framed for his fathers\u2019 murder. The prince uses his sword to grapple and swing through hell; slaying any demons that get in his way. You will confront multiple different enemies and puzzles that require the use of your sword to attack and grapple with. As you move through the layers of hell, the story unravels of who betrayed you and murdered the king; granting insight to the background of this stylized world. <br><br>Key Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiple special attacks acquired from defeating bosses <br></li><li>Earn new abilities as you gain experience from defeating enemies<br></li><li>Stylized levels and bosses that carry their own theme</li></ul><br>Hell to Raze was created by a team of 14 students in the Entertainment Arts and Engineering (EAE) Undergrad Program at the University of Utah.","developers":["Hellhound Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1254950/header.jpg?t=1597156764","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1254950/280349/e4fb90c6abd90a3d67215650f1973af6ac35c5a8/1751210259/dash_av1.mpd?t=1587512777","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1254950/280349/e4fb90c6abd90a3d67215650f1973af6ac35c5a8/1751210259/dash_h264.mpd?t=1587512777","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1254950/280349/e4fb90c6abd90a3d67215650f1973af6ac35c5a8/1751210259/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1587512777","id":256782737,"name":"Wrath Boss Preview","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256782737/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1587512777"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1254950/270865/5a31d6061fee66f68aad9c3db73b8d606427b365/1751210258/dash_av1.mpd?t=1587512781","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1254950/